13
00:00:35.757 --> 00:00:37.340
Thank you!

14
00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:40.840
Victoria, what gave you the idea to do this?

15
00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:41.940
What did you see?

16
00:00:41.940 --> 00:00:45.330
