42
00:01:52.610 --> 00:01:54.600
Will you quickly tell me about that?

43
00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:55.950
Yes ma'am.

44
00:01:55.950 --> 00:01:58.809
So I was in foster care most of my life through group homes

45
00:01:58.809 --> 00:02:01.183 line:15%
