47
00:02:04.260 --> 00:02:08.320 line:15%
So I knew how they felt, cold and hungry.

48
00:02:08.320 --> 00:02:11.960
So I just wanted to do something that I could for anybody.

49
00:02:11.960 --> 00:02:15.320
And that's when I got the idea of, let me just

50
00:02:15.320 --> 00:02:17.880
