53
00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:23.460
Victoria, I love you so much.

54
00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:26.410
And I know that you guys are paying

55
00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:28.589
for all of this with your own money

56
00:02:28.589 --> 00:02:33.450
and you just are real life angels coming to the rescue.

57
00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:34.887
Thank you.
And I'm wondering

58
00:02:34.887 --> 00:02:38.788
