(applause)

61
00:02:45.127 --> 00:02:46.127
Oh my god.

62
00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:52.640
You know what, let's just make it 10,000.

63
00:02:52.640 --> 00:02:57.260
Victoria and Katie, you have got to keep showing us

64
00:02:57.260 --> 00:02:59.094
