65
00:02:59.094 --> 00:03:00.894
Thank you so much.

66
00:03:00.894 --> 00:03:03.740
Thank you for doing everything you're doing.

67
00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:05.180
And we're gonna check back in

68
00:03:05.180 --> 00:03:07.170
